{"name": "Packing Life", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Packing turns into a fun and rewarding puzzle. As a warehouse worker, organize, rotate, and fit items into boxes, making each order neat and efficient. With limited space and unique product shapes, every package becomes a satisfying challenge. Along the way, experience a heartfelt story, unlock new items, and customize your workspace. Enjoy a cozy, relaxing experience with soothing visuals and sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"436\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/a1d7a583201ae615ddd897e903590e94.poster.avif?t=1786470827\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/a1d7a583201ae615ddd897e903590e94.webm?t=1786470827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/a1d7a583201ae615ddd897e903590e94.mp4?t=1786470827\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative Packing Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate, arrange, and fit items perfectly into boxes for the most efficient and satisfying packing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Heartfelt Story</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the journey of a warehouse worker striving to build a better future. Experience small yet meaningful moments, uncovering the stories behind each package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"436\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/c9872fb084562af9234af02d159e13ca.poster.avif?t=1786470827\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/c9872fb084562af9234af02d159e13ca.webm?t=1786470827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/c9872fb084562af9234af02d159e13ca.mp4?t=1786470827\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cozy &amp; Vibrant Art Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A warm, visually appealing design with soft colors and inviting aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Achievements &amp; Reward</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock stickers and collectibles by completing orders with precision and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"436\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/698a84a61faaa7cc78b8aa8d5de41124.poster.avif?t=1786470827\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/698a84a61faaa7cc78b8aa8d5de41124.webm?t=1786470827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/698a84a61faaa7cc78b8aa8d5de41124.mp4?t=1786470827\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Sound &amp; Music</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mix of relaxing music and immersive sound effects makes for a calming and enjoyable gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Workspace Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personalize the packing station with decorations and themes to create a unique and inviting workspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"436\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/aed36792681e688e615cdac0509c53ff.poster.avif?t=1786470827\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/aed36792681e688e615cdac0509c53ff.webm?t=1786470827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/aed36792681e688e615cdac0509c53ff.mp4?t=1786470827\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Casual Yet Engaging Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to pick up, yet rewarding for players who enjoy optimizing and perfecting their skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"436\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/22025f6663a337e14ea4a45ea4549cd5.poster.avif?t=1786470827\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/22025f6663a337e14ea4a45ea4549cd5.webm?t=1786470827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/extras/22025f6663a337e14ea4a45ea4549cd5.mp4?t=1786470827\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A cozy and satisfying puzzle-simulation game where you step into the role of a warehouse worker with a knack for perfectly organizing and packing orders. With charming visuals, relaxing gameplay, and a lighthearted story, experience the joy of transforming everyday tasks into a fulfilling adventure.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482510/6f3e2da42d6